WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.450
My name's Cole, I recently started a new business, was working on

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.890
bringing my product to market and just didn't know where to start.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.750
All the options just seemed overwhelming.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.910
I was going through Upwork trying to find some professionals and I

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:14.710
just didn't have any plan.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:19.290
I found JCE Media and it was incredible.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.670
They're seven figure blueprints.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:26.350
It gave me a entire pathway on how to move forward in my business

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.010
and how to take it to the point where I wanted to be there.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.390
I highly recommend JCE Media for anyone who's launching a new business

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:38.070
or wants to find some sort of way of scaling or automating their marketing

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:43.330
operations. Jacques was great to work with, very promptly had meetings,

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.690
he was always on time, very well prepared and the results were definitely

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.490
worth it.
